{"id":"n62596-2-5","stage":3,"title":"쏘다 · 伤人","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62596-2-5-1","ko":"공부나 하지 그런 건 알아서 뭐하냐?","zh":"好好学习不就行了，知道那些干什么？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"공부나","meaning":"学习，读书","explanation":"공부：学习，读书；나：表示不止预期的数量、举例或退而求其次等，需结合整句语气。","readings":[{"term":"공부","audio":"/audio/c9b4aed6d54a88472fe8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36672","senseId":"1","lemma":"공부","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하지","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그런","meaning":"那种，那样","explanation":"그런：那种，那样","readings":[{"term":"그런","audio":"/audio/d14f5bfb24390ed9c4da.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60341","senseId":"1","lemma":"그런","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"건","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"알아서","meaning":"管","explanation":"알다：管；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"알다","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89445","senseId":"6","lemma":"알다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뭐하냐?","meaning":"什么；做，干","explanation":"뭐：什么；하다：做，干；냐：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"},{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c9b4aed6d54a8847","term":"공부","zh":"学习，读书","audio":"/audio/c9b4aed6d54a88472fe8.mp3","entryId":"36672","definition":"通过学习学问或技术而获得知识。","pronunciation":["공부"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"d14f5bfb24390ed9","term":"그런","zh":"那种，那样","audio":"/audio/d14f5bfb24390ed9c4da.mp3","entryId":"60341","definition":"状态、模样、性质等那个样子的。","pronunciation":["그런"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]},{"id":"4646a3463436c8a4","term":"알다","zh":"管","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3","entryId":"89445","definition":"对于关联到的某事，参与并关心。","pronunciation":["알ː다"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]}],"audio":"/audio/a578369358f12f9ef682.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62596-2-5-2","ko":"그렇게 쏘지만 마시고 답을 해 주세요.","zh":"别这样冲我说话，请回答一下。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"쏘지만","meaning":"伤人，顶","explanation":"쏘다：伤人，顶；지만：表示转折或让步：“但是、虽然”。","readings":[{"term":"쏘다","audio":"/audio/b4a8059171443b9b62a3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62596","senseId":"2","lemma":"쏘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"마시고","meaning":"中断，停止","explanation":"말다：中断，停止；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"말다","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69296","senseId":"1","lemma":"말다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"답을","meaning":"应答，解答","explanation":"답：应答，解答；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"답","audio":"/audio/9d0673c3b91f0428303b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14003","senseId":"2","lemma":"답","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"해","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주세요.","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"b4a8059171443b9b","term":"쏘다","zh":"伤人，顶","audio":"/audio/b4a8059171443b9b62a3.mp3","entryId":"62596","definition":"说话凶狠凌厉让听话人伤感情。","pronunciation":["쏘ː다"]},{"id":"f8b54c8d9bfb2043","term":"말다","zh":"中断，停止","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3","entryId":"69296","definition":"不再做某事或行动。","pronunciation":["말ː다"]},{"id":"9d0673c3b91f0428","term":"답","zh":"应答，解答","audio":"/audio/9d0673c3b91f0428303b.mp3","entryId":"14003","definition":"对疑问或问题所要求的内容进行阐明；或指那种话。","pronunciation":["답"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ae070bf1b54a24132ca9.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.807,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=62596","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"중급","day":91,"sequenceScore":2.4604,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["别这样冲我说话，请回答一下。","好好学习不就行了，知道那些干什么？","今天在新闻里看到美国有飓风来袭了吧？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["好好学习不就行了，知道那些干什么？","今天在新闻里看到美国有飓风来袭了吧？","别这样冲我说话，请回答一下。"],"answer":2}]}
